  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n3 × [5 - 1 ÷ 2 - {3 + (4 - 2 ÷ 2) - (15 ÷ 5 of 3)}]\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/694d0d67bc14effd3a3679b70b4d77edef851107a6a53b64ea488e47e4c2bef5.png] **\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n3 × [5 - 1 ÷ 2 - {3 + (4 - 2 ÷ 2) - (15 ÷ 5 of 3)}]\n\n⇒ 3 × [5 - 1 ÷ 2 - {3 + (4 - 2 ÷ 2) - (15 ÷ 15)}]\n\n⇒ 3 × [5 - 1 ÷ 2 - {3 + (4 - 1) - 1}]\n\n⇒ 3 × [5 - 1 ÷ 2 - {3 + 3 - 1}]\n\n⇒ 3 × [5 - 1 ÷ 2 - {6 - 1}]\n\n⇒ 3 × [5 - 1 ÷ 2 - 5]\n\n⇒ 3 × [5 - 1/2 - 5]\n\n⇒ 3 × - 1/2\n\n⇒ -(3)/(2)\n\n**∴ Requried answer is -(3)/(2)**.",
